  {
   "text": "Time Spiral Remastered is the first remastered Magic: The Gathering set to appear in paper . It was released on March 19, 2021.",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "Time Spiral Remastered is a new way to experience the Time Spiral block originally released in 2006-2007. It features fan favorites from Time Spiral , Planar Chaos , and Future Sight all distilled into one draft experience. The set includes 289 cards from the Time Spiral block sets (121 commons, 100 uncommons, 53 rares, 15 mythic rares) . As with the original Time Spiral set, each pack contains one timeshifted card. Time Spiral Remastered is not featured on MTG Arena .",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Set details"
  },
  {
   "text": "Although cards from the respective sets appear in Time Spiral Remastered , the Planar Chaos planeshifted or Future Sight futureshifted frames don't.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Set details"
  },
  {
   "text": "The design of Time Spiral Remastered predates the digital Amonkhet Remastered and Kaladesh Remastered , and was mostly inspired by Tempest Remastered .",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Set details"
  },
  {
   "text": "The 121 timeshifted cards of this set are a specific selection of cards similar to the original Time Spiral \"outside the set and outside of time\" timeshifted cards. The timeshifted cards feature modern cards in a retro (pre-Modern) card frame and with a purple expansion symbol . Premium foil versions also have the \"shooting star\" watermark used on pre-Modern set foils. These cards are numbered #290 to #410.",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Timeshifted cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "The timeshifted sheet doesn't contain any of the original timeshifted cards. Neither does it contain planeswalkers . The cards from the timeshifted sheet all have the same rarity .",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Timeshifted cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "Time Spiral Remastered will be sold in regular 16-card Draft Boosters (one card being a marketing card ). These are the only sealed products available for the set — there are no Collector, Set, or Theme Boosters. The boosters feature artwork from Serra Avenger , Sidewinder Sliver , and Stuffy Doll . The Draft Pack (a packaging of three Draft Boosters) features Tarmogoyf key art .",
   "scene": 3,
   "section": "Marketing"
  },
  {
   "text": "In-Store Launch parties (in available regions only) and SpellTable Launch Parties: March 19–21.",
   "scene": 4,
   "section": "Events"
  },
  {
   "text": "Release card / Buy-a-Box : Lotus Bloom (pre-Modern card frame) The release card is #411.",
   "scene": 5,
   "section": "Promo"
  },
  {
   "text": "Time Spiral Remastered features fifteen tokens . Some of these tokens had been created for Magic Online , but are now printed for the first time.",
   "scene": 6,
   "section": "Token cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "2/2 Griffin creature with flying , for Griffin Guide .",
   "scene": 6,
   "section": "Token cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "1/1 Soldier creature, for Benalish Commander and Stormfront Riders .",
   "scene": 6,
   "section": "Token cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "Cloud Sprite , a 1/1 Faerie creature with flying and \"Cloud Sprite can block only creatures with flying,\" for Cloudseeder .",
   "scene": 6,
   "section": "Token cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "1/2 Bat creature with flying and \" , Sacrifice this creature: Return an exiled card named Sengir Nosferatu to the battlefield under its owner's control,\" for Sengir Nosferatu .",
   "scene": 6,
   "section": "Token cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "2/2 Knight creature with flanking , protection from white and haste , for Riftmarked Knight .",
   "scene": 6,
   "section": "Token cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "2/4 Spider creature with reach , for Penumbra Spider .",
   "scene": 6,
   "section": "Token cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "4/4 Giant creature, for Pact of the Titan .",
   "scene": 6,
   "section": "Token cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "1/1 Goblin creature, for Empty the Warrens and Mogg War Marshal .",
   "scene": 6,
   "section": "Token cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "Kobolds of Kher Keep , a 0/1 Kobold creature, for Kher Keep .",
   "scene": 6,
   "section": "Token cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "3/3 Ape creature, for Pongify .",
   "scene": 6,
   "section": "Token cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "Llanowar Elves , a 1/1 Elf Druid creature with \" : Add ,\" for Llanowar Mentor .",
   "scene": 6,
   "section": "Token cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "6/1 Insect creature with shroud , for Deadly Grub .",
   "scene": 6,
   "section": "Token cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "1/1 Saproling creature, for Deathspore Thallid , Mycologist , Pallid Mycoderm , Sporesower Thallid , Sporoloth Ancient , Thallid Germinator , Thallid Shell-Dweller , Thelonite Hermit and Utopia Mycon .",
   "scene": 6,
   "section": "Token cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "2/2 Assembly-Worker artifact creature , for Urza's Factory .",
   "scene": 6,
   "section": "Token cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "Metallic Sliver , a 1/1 Sliver artifact creature, for Sliversmith .",
   "scene": 6,
   "section": "Token cards"
  },
  {
   "text": "The returning mechanics from the original Time Spiral block include echo , flanking , flashback , morph , shadow , split second , suspend and vanishing .",
   "scene": 7,
   "section": "Themes and mechanics"
  },
  {
   "text": "In addition, there are multiple mechanics appearing on just a few or even a single card, as references to specific cards from Magic' s past, or from \" futureshifted \" cards. These include absorb , buyback , convoke , cycling , delve , hellbent , kicker , madness , poisonous , storm and transmute .",
   "scene": 7,
   "section": "Themes and mechanics"
  },
  {
   "text": "Time Spiral Remastered creature-type themes include Merfolk , Rebels , Thallids , Saprolings and Slivers . The slivers are concentrated in red, green, and white.",
   "scene": 8,
   "section": "Card types"
  },
  {
   "text": "Time Spiral Remastered has seven cycles , including one vertical cycle .",
   "scene": 9,
   "section": "Cycles"
  },
  {
   "text": "Changes in rarity, compared to their printings in the original Time Spiral block .",
   "scene": 11,
   "section": "Changes in rarity"
  },
  {
   "text": "Akroma, Angel of Fury",
